  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Risk Facility - Replenishment of Non-Food Items</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Internal Risk Facility (IRF) is a vital component of the Programme. With pre-approved funds, the IRF enables FCDO to act with speed in responding to unforeseen emergencies, including disasters and spikes in conflict-related displacement. The IRF is a flexible financing facility that reinforces the UK&#x2019;s ambition to localize humanitarian response. The IRF is not a delivery mechanism, rather it offers FCDO the flexibility to scale up other components as required.</narrative>
  </description>
